#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:422
#: 73c5261a70874c20846d48c767612e59
msgid ""
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`: This is the maximum pitch angle "
"(in degrees) that the controller will demand. It should be set to a value "
"that the aircraft can achieve whilst maintaining airspeed with the throttle "
