#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:439
#: dc61a5ee98df417d87338a651c9625b4
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP <TECS_PTCH_DAMP>`: This is the damping gain for the "
"pitch demand loop. Increase to add damping to correct for oscillations in "
"height. The default value of 0.0 will work well provided the pitch to servo "
"controller has been tuned properly."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP "
"<TECS_PTCH_DAMP>`：这是俯仰需求回路的阻尼增益。增大可增加阻尼以纠正高度振荡。默认值0.0在俯仰到舵机控制器已正确调参的情况下可以正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:448
#: ccd0832091eb442fb9010b538d0c837e
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX <TECS_SINK_MAX>`: This sets the maximum descent rate (in"
